Package: com.axs.carwidget
Name: CarPlay 小组件
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Airaw 模块式 CarPlay 组件：时间、日期与天气（Open-Meteo 联网取天气）。装好后在 Airaw → 添加小部件 → 添加 找到“时间天气”。
Maintainer: Axs
Author: Axs
Section: Axs-Tweaks
Icon: https://axs66.github.io/pro/icon/carwidget.png
Sileodepiction: https://axs66.github.io/pro/sileodepiction/carwidget/js.json
